        "\n",
        "# Home\n",
        "\n",
        "Thanks to your contributions, CESSDA has now collected key performance indicators (C-KPIs) for 2025 to measure our progress and impact within the European Research Area. \n",
        "\n",
        "This dashboard supports the validation of data. Here are some general instructions:\n",
        "\n",
        "  - **Left sidebar**: Select your country to view the SP-specific dashboard\n",
        "  - **Top right corner [...]**: Download your dashboard as an image or view source code\n",
        "  - **Legends**: \n",
        "    - [Blue]{style=\"color: blue;\"}: Validated data\n",
        "    - [Grey]{style=\"color: grey;\"}: 2025 data pending validation\n",
        "    - [Red]{style=\"color: red;\"}: Missing/unavailable data (displayed as outlier)\n",
        "\n",
        "Note: Please refer to the validation Excel file for the categorical KPIs (i.e., C-KPI-07, 09, 18, 19a)\n",
        "\n",
        "If you identified any errors, please add comments directly in the [Excel file](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1m9Phl1uxPN9hL4zmgSGFMOFs1X-UmjxP/edit?gid=663340094#gid=663340094).\n",
        "\n",
        "Moreover, please complete this short 3-question feedback [survey](https://forms.gle/KJnVJj9qKyhUJCm87) by **2 July 2026**. One response per SP is sufficient.\n",
        "\n",
        "If you have any questions, please contact Lorraine Wong, Senior Science Officer at the CESSDA Main Office <lorraine.wong@cessda.eu>.\n",
        "\n",
        "Thank you for your time and input!\n",
        "\n",
